#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:22
msgid "ICON Mesh (Projected)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:24
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to render a projected unstructured triangular "
"mesh."
msgstr "この例は，投影された非構造三角メッシュのレンダリング方法を示します．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:27
msgid "📋 Summary"
msgstr "📋 まとめ"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:29
msgid ""
"Creates a mesh from 2D latitude and longitude unstructured cell bounds."
msgstr "2次元の緯度と経度の非構造セル境界からメッシュを作成します．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:31
msgid "The resulting mesh contains triangular cells."
msgstr "結果のメッシュは三角形セルを含みます．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:33
msgid ""
"It uses Icosahedral Nonhydrostatic Weather and Climate Model (ICON) global "
"160km resolution soil type data, as developed by the Deutscher Wetterdienst "
"(DWD) and the Max-Planck-Institut für Meteorologie (MPI-M). The data targets"
" the mesh faces/cells."
msgstr ""
"Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD) と Max-Planck-Institut für Meteorologie (MPI-M) "
"によって開発された，Icosahedral Nonhydrostatic Weather and Climate Model (ICON) "
"全球160km解像度土壌タイプデータを使用します．データはメッシュ面/セルを対象とします．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:38
msgid ""
"Note that Natural Earth coastlines are also rendered, and the mesh is "
"transformed to the Equidistant Cylindrical (Plate Carrée) conformal "
"cylindrical projection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/icon_eqc.rst:48
msgid ""
"🏷 Tags: component: coastlines load: unstructured projection: crs style: "
"colormap version: 0.1.0"
msgstr ""

